# Same report/log files as above, but written relative to a module's own directory instead of
# the repo root -- happens whenever tests exercising LinkageDisequilibriumAnalyzer with no
# explicit outputFile run with a module dir as the working directory (e.g. `mvn -pl ld-service
# test`, ld-service's Phase 8a tests). Previously only ld-validation/ld-tools ever hit this
# path; ld-service's new /genotypes/file test does too.
